  "adapters": "Capture caller npub contracts are extracted from the active source components and verified against the actual recordLearningEvidence/updateBucket entry; omitted callers preserve its sign-in failure. Initial note and evidence payload fixtures execute original declarations. The original pre-persistence capture block runs with an explicit note-bucket snapshot; new capture cases are independently checked against the complete original async callback with inert persistence/evidence/enrichment I/O. A fixed random input is used only in the new fixtures. Original summary templates, supported UI codes and English-cleanup tokens are also generated into native Swift. Only provider awaits become explicit synchronous response snapshots; native code executes their recorded requests and retries. Original buildMemoryNote creates initial Tutor capture fields, including localized pending summary, blank enrichment, error/repair mode and the Pre-A1 fallback. Only its random note ID is excluded from fixture equality; production keeps the source ID generator. Original prompts, parsers, language guards, signatures, status and copy rules remain. No stores, React, DOM, Firebase or network executes.",
